<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CHILLERS CAUTIONS IT IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>CHILLERS CAUTIONS IT IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food company Chillers Group</p>
<p>Ltd said on Monday it was in talks which could have an impact on</p>
<p>its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in</p>
<p>their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
